    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oboi is a homegrown software that turns your controller into a responsive and intuitive vibrator. Explore different vibration rhythms and intensities, and let your fingers discover the endless possibilities. Oboi was developed with care, so that you can focus on the most important thing \u2013 you! Instead of menus or settings, Oboi's vibrations are all in response to the way you touch your controller. Enter full screen mode for warm, abstract visuals, or enjoy in windowed mode using visuals of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571700/extras/fa32f47363315b0fe2ad5cc75bfecf60.poster.avif?t=1752116299\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571700/extras/fa32f47363315b0fe2ad5cc75bfecf60.webm?t=1752116299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571700/extras/fa32f47363315b0fe2ad5cc75bfecf60.mp4?t=1752116299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windowed or Fullscreen mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of rhythms and pulses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm, abstract visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menu diving or set up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571700/extras/bd849dd9cba661d14f7d54124b9fd8cc.avif?t=1752116299\" data-has-big width=800 height=722 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
